Assert.That(p95, Is.LessThan(15.0), ...);
Assert.That(maxMs, Is.LessThan(combinedWaveCiEnvelopeMs), $"Combined think max exceeded CI envelope: {maxMs:F3}");
```

This restores pre-c3be44d963 semantics but tighter (100→25 envelope, 25→10 max). Both keep hard CI gates that current code passes with margin, keep the aspirational budgets visible.

