This handler genuinely needs GameEngine (stores it, passes to OnActivated delegate, Update uses engine). Replacing requires deeper refactor of the runtime class contract (OnActivated signature, _activeEngine field, Update(GameEngine,...)). 

**Site 2 (line 131, HandleMapUnloadedAsync)**: needs engine?.CurrentMapSession?.MapId fallback — can use `context.GetMapSession()?.MapId.Value` — GetMapSession is a sanctioned port! Clean fix:
```csharp
